From 658b36f4d42db349e0e9075ab8fa1d8b5c305e89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mawleesys <alsoalberdo@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:49:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Prefix catalog: per-server LuckPerms import,
 wipe-authoritative full export

POST /api/azlink/prefixes/catalog, incremental migration (server_id + auto
fields), quest-only cabinet. Full export deletes missing groups and clears
player selected/available on that server. No CRUD, no overrides.
Does not rewrite 0001 tables.
